{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T11:41:52.009Z","author":"pm-github","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"ci","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"The spec requires exact use-site bindings in native glossary state. The current package stores senses, aliases and replay in the native owner, and reserves an empty collection for bindings.\n\n> All authoritative glossary state and exact use-site bindings live in SDK custom fields and native history with no side files or Git runtime requirement\n\n`ARCHITECTURE.md`, `README.md`, and PR #1 document the deferral. The `docs/real-data.md` records zero bindings. The package already tracks the implementation as `pm-glossary-3jep`.\n\nAdd an authorized native binding operation with immutable source revision and exact UTF-8 span evidence. Cover concurrent binds, stale revisions, changed/absent/inaccessible sources, and replay without duplicate history. Verify that the CLI and SDK share the binding contract and work in a plain tracker."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-glossary-github-79fd2ba382d9-40"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Unmet spec criteria: exact use-site bindings and freshness evidence"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH issue #40: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-glossary/issues/40 · author @unbraind · state reason completed · created 2026-11-24T19:11:43Z · updated 2026-11-26T02:14:49Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["gh:unbraind/pm-glossary#40","github_author:unbraind"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-28T11:41:52.009Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T11:41:52.009Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pm-github"}],